# ─── Knowledge graph ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Commit only the queryable graph + human-readable report; everything else is
# regenerable locally via `graphify update .` (see the post-commit hook).
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# ─── Clinical data guard ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing resembling patient data belongs in this repo. Synthetic fixtures live
# in backend/src/fixtures/ and are committed deliberately.
*.phi.json
/transcripts/
/patient-data/
